# Rust
target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock
# …but DO track the contracts lock: reproducible WASM builds. Without it, CI
# floats to newly-published incompatible crates (this break: ed25519-dalek 3.0.0).
!contracts/Cargo.lock
# Soroban contract cost-analysis snapshots are tracked in git so the
# whole team runs against the same baseline. Regenerate locally with
# `cargo test --release` if the budget shifts.

