KNOWN_ISSUES.md
# Blue-green staging secrets (keep the .example template tracked)
.env.staging
!.env.staging.example
# Production deploy state (resumable PROD_* contract ids; from deploy_production.sh)
.env.production

# ── TradingView Advanced Charts / Trading Platform (PROPRIETARY) ─────────────
# The Free Advanced Charts Agreement (Section 2.5) forbids the library from
# living in a public repo. Breach = US$50,000 per Section 7.5. Vendor it
# privately and copy the static files in at BUILD time only — never commit them.
# Also enforced loudly by scripts/guard-no-tradingview.sh (pre-commit + CI).
**/charting_library/
**/datafeeds/
**/charting_library.standalone.js
**/charting_library.min.js
**/charting_library.esm.js
# NOTE: your OWN wrapper + datafeed ARE meant to be committed — just keep them
# out of the paths above, e.g. web/components/trading/AdvancedChart.tsx and
# web/lib/tvchart/datafeed.ts (a folder literally named datafeeds/ is ignored).

# macOS/iCloud sync duplicates ("file 2.ext", "file 3.ext") — these appear
# whenever iCloud Drive resolves a sync conflict; never commit them.
* 2.*
* 3.*
* 2
* 3

# Batch-1 deploy inputs (secrets + resume state)
.env.batch1.*
